<title>POLAND: Paged planned rights to go 1-for-4.</title>
<headline>Paged planned rights to go 1-for-4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wood trader Paged SA will propose shareholders on June 26 that the firm's planned 2,010,050-share rights issue go on a one-for-four basis, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Paged said the issue price would be 70 percent of the average price of the previous 30 sessions before the date the price was announced but would not be less than eight zlotys.</p>
<p>Paged closed on Wednesday at 10.1 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
